; The plaza floor is brick and the walkways laid over it are asphalt, which is
; the way round a real park does it: the path is the cheap hard-wearing thing
; you walk along and the plaza is the decorative thing it crosses. World-space
; triplanar so the bond runs continuously across this slab, the street's and the
; apron's — three separate boxes, one floor. Tiles and tint match
; `_ground_material("brick")` in `tools/gen_props.gd`; change them together.
